config I2C_PIPOWER5
	tristate "PiPower5 I2C driver"
	depends on I2C
	help
	  Say Y or M here if you have a PiPower5 power management board connected
	  to an I2C bus on your system. This driver provides battery monitoring,
	  power management, and system control capabilities for the PiPower5 HAT.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will be
	  called pipower5.

	  If unsure, say N.